# Python dependencies of the docs site (PRD 35 §1). This is the hand-edited input;
# docs/requirements.txt is compiled from it with hashes. To change or upgrade a dependency,
# edit this file, then run (Python 3.13, the version docs.yml uses):
#   pip install pip-tools
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --strip-extras --output-file docs/requirements.txt docs/requirements.in
# mike (versioned docs) is added at v1.0 (PRD 35 §1); until then the site is a single `latest`.
